msgid "Our plugins"
msgstr "Meie pistikprogrammid"

msgid "Lynbro plugins"
msgstr "Lynbro pistikprogrammid"

msgid ""
"Generous, privacy-first WordPress plugins — built in Denmark. Free cores, no"
" credits, your data stays on your site."
msgstr ""
"Helded, privaatsust esikohale seadvad WordPressi pistikprogrammid — loodud "
"Taanis. Tasuta põhiversioonid, krediite pole, teie andmed jäävad teie "
"saidile."

msgid "More from Lynbro"
msgstr "Veel Lynbrolt"

msgid ""
"Our growing suite of free, privacy-first plugins. Already-installed ones are"
" marked."
msgstr ""
"Meie kasvav valik tasuta, privaatsust esikohale seadvad pistikprogramme. "
"Juba paigaldatud märgitakse ära."

msgid "Installed"
msgstr "Paigaldatud"

msgid "On WordPress.org"
msgstr "WordPress.org-is"

msgid "Coming soon"
msgstr "Peagi tulekul"

msgid "Install"
msgstr "Paigalda"

msgid "Learn more"
msgstr "Lisateave"

msgid "About Lynbro"
msgstr "Lynbrost"

msgid ""
"Lynbro builds genuinely free, privacy-first WordPress plugins with generous "
"free cores — no credits, no paywalls on the essentials, your data on your "
"own site. Made in Denmark."
msgstr ""
"Lynbro loob tõeliselt tasuta, privaatsust esikohale seadvaid WordPressi "
"pistikprogramme heldete tasuta põhiversioonidega — krediite pole, oluliste "
"funktsioonide eest ei maksa, teie andmed on teie enda saidil. Valmistatud "
"Taanis."

msgid "Visit Lynbro"
msgstr "Külastage Lynbrot"

msgid "Suggest a feature or report a bug"
msgstr "Soovitage funktsiooni või teatage veast"

msgid ""
"Feedback opens our public roadmap on plugins.lynbro.dk in a new tab — "
"nothing is sent from your site."
msgstr ""
"Tagasiside avab meie avaliku tegevuskava saidil plugins.lynbro.dk uuel "
"vahekaardil — teie saidilt midagi ei saadeta."

msgid "Tools"
msgstr "Tööriistad"

msgid ""
"Export this plugin&#8217;s settings as a JSON backup, or reset them to "
"defaults. 100% local — nothing leaves your site."
msgstr ""
"Eksportige selle pistikprogrammi seaded JSON-varukoopiana või lähtestage "
"need vaikeväärtustele. 100% lokaalne — miski ei lahku teie saidilt."

msgid "Export settings (JSON)"
msgstr "Ekspordi seaded (JSON)"

msgid "Reset to defaults"
msgstr "Lähtesta vaikeväärtustele"

msgid "About Lynbro SMTP"
msgstr "Lynbro SMTP kohta"

msgid ""
"WordPress sends email with PHP mail() by default, which inboxes treat as "
"suspicious. Lynbro SMTP sends it through a real, authenticated mail server "
"instead — the one of your host, your mailbox or a sending service — so "
"password resets, orders and contact forms arrive."
msgstr ""
"WordPress saadab e-kirju vaikimisi PHP mail() kaudu, mida postkastid peavad "
"kahtlaseks. Lynbro SMTP saadab need hoopis päris autentitud meiliserveri "
"kaudu — sinu hostingu, postkasti või saatmisteenuse kaudu — nii et "
"paroolitaastamised, tellimused ja kontaktivormid jõuavad kohale."

msgid ""
"Everything is in the free plugin: the log, resend, the backup connection, "
"alerts, diagnostics and WP-CLI. There is no paid version."
msgstr ""
"Kõik on tasuta lisas olemas: logi, uuesti saatmine, varuühendus, hoiatused, "
"diagnostika ja WP-CLI. Tasulist versiooni ei ole."

msgid "How your data is handled"
msgstr "Kuidas sinu andmeid käsitletakse"

msgid ""
"Email goes straight from your server to the SMTP server you set. The plugin "
"contacts no Lynbro service and sends no statistics anywhere."
msgstr ""
"E-kiri liigub otse sinu serverist SMTP-serverisse, mille seadistasid. Lisand"
" ei ühendu ühegi Lynbro teenusega ega saada kuhugi statistikat."

msgid ""
"The SMTP password is encrypted with your site's security keys, never shown "
"again and never written to the log or the settings export."
msgstr ""
"SMTP parool krüptitakse sinu saidi turvavõtmetega, seda ei näidata enam "
"uuesti ja seda ei kirjutata logisse ega seadete ekspordi faili."

msgid ""
"The log keeps recipients, subject and status in your own database. Message "
"content only for failed emails by default, and every entry is deleted after "
"the retention period."
msgstr ""
"Logi säilitab sinu andmebaasis adressaadid, teema ja oleku. Sõnumi sisu "
"salvestatakse vaikimisi ainult ebaõnnestunud e-kirjade puhul ning iga kirje "
"kustutatakse säilitusperioodi lõpus."

msgid ""
"Log entries are included in Tools → Export Personal Data and Erase Personal "
"Data."
msgstr ""
"Logikirjed on kaasatud tööriistadesse → Isikuandmete eksportimine ja "
"Isikuandmete kustutamine."

msgid ""
"A failure webhook, if you set one, receives only the error text and a link "
"to your log."
msgstr ""
"Tõrke webhook, kui selle seadistad, saab ainult veateksti ja lingi sinu "
"logisse."

msgid "Keep the login in wp-config.php"
msgstr "Hoia sisselogimisandmed failis wp-config.php"

msgid ""
"Any of these constants overrides the field in Settings, and the value never "
"reaches the database or its backups:"
msgstr ""
"Ükskõik milline neist konstantidest asendab välja jaotises Seaded ning "
"väärtus ei jõua kunagi andmebaasi ega selle varukoopiatesse:"

