msgstr "Versioon"

msgid "Plugin home page"
msgstr "Lisa koduleht"

msgid "Lynbro"
msgstr "Lynbro"

msgid "Send a test email"
msgstr "Saada testkiri"

msgid ""
"No SMTP server is set yet, so the test goes out with PHP mail(). Fill in "
"Settings first to test SMTP."
msgstr ""
"SMTP-serverit pole veel määratud, seega saadetakse test PHP mail() kaudu. "
"Täida esmalt seadistused, et SMTP-d testida."

msgid "Recipient"
msgstr "Adressaat"

msgid "Test the backup connection"
msgstr "Testi varuühendust"

msgid "SMTP conversation (password hidden)"
msgstr "SMTP vestlus (parool peidetud)"

msgid ""
"Test emails ignore test mode and \"do not send\" mode, so you can check the "
"connection on a staging copy."
msgstr ""
"Testkirjad eiravad testrežiimi ja \"ära saada\" režiimi, nii et saad "
"ühendust kontrollida ka staging-koopias."

msgid "Can this server reach the SMTP server?"
msgstr "Kas see server saab SMTP-serveriga ühendust?"

msgid ""
"Many hosts block outgoing mail ports. This checks the usual ones to your "
"saved host, from this web server."
msgstr ""
"Paljud hostid blokeerivad väljaminevate kirjade porte. See kontrollib "
"tavapäraseid porte sinu salvestatud hostini sellest veebiserverist."

msgid "Check ports"
msgstr "Kontrolli porte"

msgid "Sender domain: %s"
msgstr "Saatja domeen: %s"

msgid "DNS lookups are not available on this server."
msgstr "DNS-päringud pole sellel serveril saadaval."

msgid ""
"Make sure it includes your SMTP provider (for example "
"include:spf.brevo.com)."
msgstr ""
"Veendu, et see sisaldab sinu SMTP teenusepakkujat (näiteks "
"include:spf.brevo.com)."

msgid ""
"No SPF record. Add one at your DNS host that names your SMTP provider, or "
"many inboxes will distrust the email."
msgstr ""
"SPF-kirjet pole. Lisa oma DNS-teenusepakkuja juures kirje, mis nimetab sinu "
"SMTP teenusepakkuja, muidu paljud postkastid ei usalda seda e-kirja."

msgid ""
"No DMARC record. Gmail and Yahoo require one for bulk senders; even a simple"
" \"v=DMARC1; p=none\" helps."
msgstr ""
"DMARC-kirjet pole. Gmail ja Yahoo nõuavad seda suurtes kogustes saatjatelt; "
"isegi lihtne \"v=DMARC1; p=none\" aitab."

msgid ""
"DKIM is set up at your SMTP provider (they give you the DNS record). It "
"cannot be checked from here without the selector name."
msgstr ""
"DKIM on seadistatud sinu SMTP teenusepakkuja juures (nemad annavad DNS-"
"kirje). Seda ei saa siit kontrollida ilma valija nimeta."

