msgid "About"
msgstr "Teave"

msgid ""
"Send every WordPress email through your own SMTP server — with an email log,"
" resend, a backup connection and failure alerts. All free, no upsells."
msgstr ""
"Saada kõik WordPressi e-kirjad läbi oma SMTP-serveri — koos e-posti logi, "
"uuesti saatmise, varuühenduse ja tõrketeavitustega. Täiesti tasuta, ilma "
"lisamüükideta."

msgid "The email was sent again."
msgstr "E-kiri saadeti uuesti."

msgid ""
"The email could not be sent again — see the newest log entry for the reason."
msgstr ""
"E-kirja ei saanud uuesti saata — vaata põhjuse saamiseks uusimat logikirjet."

msgid "The content of this email was not kept, so it cannot be resent."
msgstr "Selle e-kirja sisu ei säilitatud, seega ei saa seda uuesti saata."

msgid "Log entries deleted."
msgstr "Logikirjed kustutatud."

msgid ""
"Settings imported. Enter the SMTP password once and save — passwords are "
"never copied from other plugins."
msgstr ""
"Seaded imporditud. Sisestage SMTP parool üks kord ja salvestage — paroole ei"
" kopeerita kunagi teistest pluginatest."

msgid "Set in wp-config.php"
msgstr "Määratud failis wp-config.php"

msgid "Email is sent through %1$s on port %2$s."
msgstr "E-kiri saadetakse läbi %1$s pordil %2$s."

msgid ""
"No SMTP server set yet — WordPress still sends with PHP mail(). Pick your "
"provider below, fill in the login and save."
msgstr ""
"SMTP-serverit veel pole määratud — WordPress saadab endiselt PHP mail()-i "
"kaudu. Valige allpool oma teenusepakkuja, täitke sisselogimisandmed ja "
"salvestage."

msgid "Delivery is switched off: emails are logged but not sent."
msgstr ""
"Tarnimine on välja lülitatud: e-kirjad logitakse, kuid neid ei saadeta."

msgid "Test mode: every email goes to %s instead of its recipients."
msgstr "Testrežiim: iga e-kiri läheb adressaatide asemel aadressile %s."

msgid ""
"The saved password can no longer be read because the site's security keys "
"changed. Enter it again and save."
msgstr ""
"Salvestatud parooli ei saa enam lugeda, რადგან saidi turvavõtmed muutusid. "
"Sisestage see uuesti ja salvestage."

msgid "Last failure %1$s ago: %2$s"
msgstr "Viimane tõrge %1$s tagasi: %2$s"

msgid "Show failed emails"
msgstr "Kuva ebaõnnestunud e-kirjad"

msgid ""
"Also active: %s. Two mail plugins fight over the same email — deactivate the"
" other one."
msgstr ""
"Samuti aktiivne: %s. Kaks meilipluginat võistlevad sama e-kirja pärast — "
"deaktiveerige teine."

msgid "Import settings from %s"
msgstr "Impordi seaded aadressilt %s"

msgid "SMTP server"
msgstr "SMTP-server"

msgid "Provider"
msgstr "Teenusepakkuja"

msgid "Port and encryption"
msgstr "Port ja krüptimine"

msgid "TLS (STARTTLS) — usually port 587"
msgstr "TLS (STARTTLS) — tavaliselt port 587"

msgid "SSL — usually port 465"
msgstr "SSL — tavaliselt port 465"

msgid "None — only for a server on the same network"
msgstr "Puudub — ainult samas võrgus oleva serveri jaoks"

msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "Autentimine"

msgid "The server needs a username and password (almost always)"
msgstr "Server vajab kasutajanime ja parooli (peaaegu alati)"

msgid ""
"The password comes from LYNBRO_SMTP_PASS in wp-config.php and is not stored "
"in the database."
msgstr ""
"Parool tuleb failist LYNBRO_SMTP_PASS wp-config.php-s ega salvestata "
"andmebaasi."

msgid "Saved — leave empty to keep it"
msgstr "Salvestatud — jätke tühjaks, et alles hoida"

msgid "Remove the saved password"
msgstr "Eemalda salvestatud parool"

msgid ""
"Stored encrypted with your site's security keys and never shown again. To "
"keep it out of the database entirely, define it in wp-config.php (see "
"About)."
msgstr ""
"Salvestatakse krüptitult teie saidi turvavõtmetega ja seda ei näidata enam "
"kunagi. Et see ei läheks üldse andmebaasi, määrake see failis wp-config.php "
"(vt Teave)."

msgid "Certificate"
msgstr "Sertifikaat"

msgid "Verify the server certificate"
msgstr "Kontrolli serveri sertifikaati"

msgid "Default"
msgstr "Vaikimisi"

msgid "Untick only for your own server with a self-signed certificate."
msgstr ""
"Eemaldage märge ainult oma serveri puhul, millel on iseallkirjastatud "
"sertifikaat."

msgid "Sender"
msgstr "Saatja"

msgid "Force this address on every email, whatever other plugins set"
msgstr ""
"Sunni see aadress igale e-kirjale, olenemata sellest, mida teised pluginad "
"määravad"

msgid "Recommended"
msgstr "Soovitatav"

msgid ""
"Use an address on a domain your SMTP account may send for, or providers "
"reject or spam-folder the email."
msgstr ""
"Kasuta aadressi domeenil, millelt sinu SMTP-konto võib kirju saata, vastasel"
" juhul võivad teenusepakkujad need tagasi lükata või rämpsposti saata."

msgid "Force this name too (off: forms and shops keep their own sender name)"
msgstr ""
"Sundi ka see nimi (väljas: vormid ja e-poed säilitavad oma saatja nime)"

msgid "Default Reply-To"
msgstr "Vaikimisi Reply-To"

msgid ""
"Used only when an email has no Reply-To of its own, so contact-form replies "
"still go to the visitor."
msgstr ""
"Kasutatakse ainult siis, kui e-kirjal pole oma Reply-To aadressi, et "
"kontaktivormi vastused jõuaksid siiski külastajani."

msgid "Return-Path"
msgstr "Return-Path"

msgid "Send bounces to the From address"
msgstr "Saada põrked From-aadressile"

msgid "Backup connection"
msgstr "Varuühendus"

msgid ""
"When the main server fails, the same email is sent again through the backup "
"at once — the visitor never sees an error."
msgstr ""
"Kui põhiserver ei tööta, saadetakse sama e-kiri kohe varuühenduse kaudu "
"uuesti — külastaja ei näe kunagi viga."

msgid "Backup"
msgstr "Varukoopia"

msgid "Use a backup when the main server fails"
msgstr "Kasuta varuühendust, kui põhiserver ei tööta"

msgid "Another SMTP server"
msgstr "Teine SMTP-server"

msgid "PHP mail() of this server (better than nothing; may land in spam)"
msgstr ""
"Selle serveri PHP mail() (parem kui mitte midagi; võib sattuda rämpsposti)"

msgid "Backup host"
msgstr "Varuserver"

msgid "Backup port"
msgstr "Varuport"

msgid "Backup encryption"
msgstr "Varu krüptimine"

msgid "None"
msgstr "Puudub"

msgid "Backup login"
msgstr "Varu sisselogimine"

msgid "Backup password"
msgstr "Varu parool"

msgid "Delivery mode"
msgstr "Kättetoimetamise režiim"

msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Režiim"

msgid "Send normally"
msgstr "Saada tavaliselt"

msgid "Test mode: send everything to one address (Cc and Bcc are dropped)"
msgstr "Testrežiim: saada kõik ühele aadressile (Cc ja Bcc jäetakse välja)"

msgid "Redirect address"
msgstr "Ümbersuunamise aadress"

msgid "Do not send any email (staging copies) — emails are still logged"
msgstr "Ära saada ühtegi e-kirja (stendikoopiad) — e-kirju logitakse siiski"

msgid "Log"
msgstr "Logi"

msgid "Keep a log of every email (recipient, subject, status, error)"
msgstr "Salvesta iga e-kirja logi (saaja, teema, olek, tõrge)"

msgid "Keep message content"
msgstr "Säilita sõnumi sisu"

msgid "Only of failed emails, so they can be resent"
msgstr "Ainult ebaõnnestunud e-kirjade puhul, et neid saaks uuesti saata"

msgid ""
"Of every email (lets you resend anything; the log then holds password-reset "
"links and order details)"
msgstr ""
"Iga e-kirja puhul (lubab sul kõike uuesti saata; logis on siis parooli "
"lähtestamise lingid ja tellimuse andmed)"

msgid "Never"
msgstr "Mitte kunagi"

msgid "Keep entries for"
msgstr "Säilita kirjed"

msgid "days, then they are deleted automatically"
msgstr "päeva, seejärel kustutatakse need automaatselt"

msgid "Failure alerts"
msgstr "Tõrkehoiatused"

msgid ""
"At most one alert per hour. The alert email is sent with PHP mail() of this "
"server, because the SMTP server may be the thing that is down."
msgstr ""
"Maksimaalselt üks hoiatus tunnis. Hoiatuse e-kiri saadetakse selle serveri "
"PHP mail() kaudu, sest just SMTP-server võib olla maas."

msgid "Alert email"
msgstr "Hoiatuse e-kiri"

msgid "Webhook URL"
msgstr "Veebikonksu URL"

msgid ""
"Optional. Slack, Discord, Microsoft Teams workflows, ntfy or your own "
"endpoint (HTTPS). The plugin posts the error text there — nothing else, and "
"only when you set a URL."
msgstr ""
"Valikuline. Slacki, Discordi, Microsoft Teamsi töövood, ntfy või sinu enda "
"lõpp-punkt (HTTPS). Plugin postitab sinna veateate — midagi muud mitte, ja "
"ainult siis, kui määrad URL-i."

msgid "Import from another SMTP plugin"
msgstr "Impordi teisest SMTP pluginist"

msgid ""
"Copies host, port, encryption, username and sender. Passwords stay where "
"they are — enter yours once after importing."
msgstr ""
"Kopeerib hosti, pordi, krüptimise, kasutajanime ja saatja. Paroolid jäävad "
"sinna, kus nad on — sisesta oma parool pärast importi üks kord."

msgid "Import from %s"
msgstr "Impordi %s-ist"

msgid ""
"No settings of WP Mail SMTP, FluentSMTP, Easy WP SMTP or Post SMTP were "
"found on this site."
msgstr ""
"Sellelt saidilt ei leitud WP Mail SMTP, FluentSMTP, Easy WP SMTP ega Post "
"SMTP seadeid."

msgid "Download the log (CSV)"
msgstr "Laadi logi alla (CSV)"

msgid "Delete every log entry?"
msgstr "Kas kustutada kõik logikirjed?"

msgid "Empty the log"
msgstr "Tühjenda logi"

msgid "Is it working for you?"
msgstr "Kas see töötab sinu jaoks?"

msgid ""
"Lynbro SMTP is free, with nothing locked. If it got your email delivered, a "
"short review helps other people find it."
msgstr ""
"Lynbro SMTP on tasuta, ilma lukustatud funktsioonideta. Kui see aitas sinu "
"e-kirja kohale toimetada, aitab lühike arvustus teistel seda leida."

msgid "Leave a review on WordPress.org"
msgstr "Jäta arvustus WordPress.org-is"

msgid "Something missing or broken?"
msgstr "Kas midagi on puudu või katki?"

msgid ""
"Bug reports and ideas are read by the people who build the plugin. Opening "
"these links sends nothing from your site."
msgstr ""
"Veaaruandeid ja ideid loevad inimesed, kes pluginat loovad. Nende linkide "
"avamine ei saada sinu saidilt midagi."

msgid "Ask in the support forum"
msgstr "Küsi tugifoorumist"

msgid "Suggest a feature (public roadmap)"
msgstr "Paku funktsioon välja (avalik teekaart)"

msgid ""
"Posting a log line? Remove addresses first — the Test tab already hides the "
"password."
msgstr ""
"Postitad logirea? Eemalda aadressid enne — Testi vahekaart peidab juba "
"parooli."

msgid "You do not have permission to do that."
msgstr "Sul ei ole selleks õigusi."

msgid "Enter a valid recipient address."
msgstr "Sisesta kehtiv saaja aadress."

msgid ""
"%1$s: the main SMTP connection failed and the backup delivered the email. "
"Error: %2$s"
msgstr ""
"%1$s: peamine SMTP ühendus ebaõnnestus ja varuühendus toimetas e-kirja "
"kohale. Viga: %2$s"

msgid "%1$s: an email could not be sent. Error: %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s: e-kirja ei saadetud. Viga: %2$s"

msgid "Log entry #%d"
msgstr "Logikirje #%d"

msgid "[%s] Email delivery problem"
msgstr "[%s] E-kirja kohaletoimetamise probleem"

msgid "Email delivery"
msgstr "E-kirja kohaletoimetamine"

msgid "Email is sent through SMTP"
msgstr "E-kirjad saadetakse SMTP kaudu"

msgid "Email"
msgstr "E-kiri"

msgid ""
"Lynbro SMTP sends this site's email through an authenticated SMTP server."
msgstr ""
"Lynbro SMTP saadab selle saidi e-kirjad autentitud SMTP-serveri kaudu."

msgid "Open Lynbro SMTP"
msgstr "Ava Lynbro SMTP"

msgid "Email is sent with PHP mail(), not SMTP"
msgstr "E-kirjad saadetakse PHP mail() kaudu, mitte SMTP kaudu"

msgid ""
"Lynbro SMTP is active but no SMTP server is set, so email still leaves "
"through PHP mail() and often lands in spam."
msgstr ""
"Lynbro SMTP on aktiivne, kuid SMTP-serverit pole seadistatud, seega liiguvad"
" e-kirjad endiselt PHP mail() kaudu ja satuvad sageli rämpsposti."

msgid "The saved SMTP password can no longer be read"
msgstr "Salvestatud SMTP parooli ei saa enam lugeda"

msgid ""
"The site's security keys changed after the password was saved. Enter the "
"SMTP password again."
msgstr ""
"Saidi turvavõtmed muutusid pärast parooli salvestamist. Sisesta SMTP parool "
"uuesti."

msgid "Emails failed to send in the last 24 hours"
msgstr "E-kirjade saatmine ebaõnnestus viimase 24 tunni jooksul"

msgid "The main SMTP connection failed in the last 24 hours"
msgstr "Peamine SMTP ühendus ebaõnnestus viimase 24 tunni jooksul"

msgid "Email delivery (7 days)"
msgstr "E-kirjade kohaletoimetamine (7 päeva)"

msgid "Sent: %1$s · Failed: %2$s"
msgstr "Saadetud: %1$s · Ebaõnnestunud: %2$s"

msgid "No SMTP server is set yet — email is sent with PHP mail()."
msgstr ""
"SMTP-serverit pole veel seadistatud — e-kirjad saadetakse PHP mail() kaudu."

msgid "Show failed"
msgstr "Kuva ebaõnnestunud"

msgid "Main connection: %1$s — Backup connection: %2$s"
msgstr "Peamine ühendus: %1$s — varuühendus: %2$s"

msgid "Test email from %s"
msgstr "Testkiri aadressilt %s"

msgid ""
"This is a test email from %1$s, sent by Lynbro SMTP.\n"
"\n"
"If you can read it, email delivery works.\n"
"\n"
"Sent: %2$s\n"
"Connection: %3$s"
msgstr ""
"See on testkiri saidilt %1$s, saadetud Lynbro SMTP kaudu.\n"
"\n"
"Kui saad seda lugeda, töötab e-kirjade kohaletoimetamine.\n"
"\n"
"Saadetud: %2$s\n"
"Ühendus: %3$s"

msgid "backup"
msgstr "varu"

msgid "main"
msgstr "peamine"

msgid ""
"The server refused the username or password. Gmail, Outlook, Zoho and iCloud"
" need an app password, not the normal one; SendGrid and Brevo need an "
"SMTP/API key."
msgstr ""
"Server keeldus kasutajanimest või paroolist. Gmail, Outlook, Zoho ja iCloud "
"vajavad rakenduse parooli, mitte tavalist parooli; SendGrid ja Brevo vajavad"
" SMTP-/API-võtit."

msgid ""
"Microsoft 365 has SMTP sign-in switched off for this mailbox. An "
"administrator can enable \"Authenticated SMTP\" for it, or use a relay "
"service instead."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft 365-s on selle postkasti SMTP sisselogimine välja lülitatud. "
"Administraator saab selle jaoks lubada \"Autenticated SMTP\" või kasutada "
"selle asemel releeteenust."

msgid ""
"The server could not be reached. Many hosts block outgoing ports 25, 465 and"
" 587 — run the port check below, then ask your host to open the port or use "
"the one that is open."
msgstr ""
"Serveriga ei õnnestunud ühendust luua. Paljud hostid blokeerivad "
"väljaminevad pordid 25, 465 ja 587 — käivitage allolev pordikontroll ja "
"paluge seejärel hostil port avada või kasutada seda, mis on avatud."

msgid ""
"The secure connection failed. Check that port and encryption match (587 = "
"TLS, 465 = SSL). If the server uses a self-signed certificate, untick "
"\"Verify the server certificate\"."
msgstr ""
"Turvaline ühendus ebaõnnestus. Kontrollige, et port ja krüptimine sobiksid "
"(587 = TLS, 465 = SSL). Kui server kasutab isesigneeritud sertifikaati, "
"eemaldage märge \"Verify the server certificate\" eest."

msgid ""
"The server does not let this account send as the From address. Use an "
"address on a domain the account owns, and switch on \"Force From email\"."
msgstr ""
"Server ei luba sellel kontol saata From-aadressina. Kasutage aadressi "
"domeenil, mis kuulub kontole, ja lülitage sisse \"Force From email\"."

msgid "The host name does not resolve. Check it for typos."
msgstr "Hostinime ei leitud. Kontrollige, kas selles on kirjavigu."

msgid ""
"Read the last SERVER lines of the transcript: the server usually says "
"exactly what it did not like."
msgstr ""
"Lugege ärakirja viimaseid SERVER ridu: server ütleb tavaliselt täpselt, mis "
"talle ei meeldinud."

msgid "No host set."
msgstr "Host puudub."

msgid "That log entry no longer exists."
msgstr "Seda logikirjet enam ei ole."

msgid ""
"The content of this email was not kept, so it cannot be resent. Change "
"\"Keep message content\" in Settings to resend future emails."
msgstr ""
"Selle e-kirja sisu ei salvestatud, seega ei saa seda uuesti saata. Muutke "
"tulevaste e-kirjade uuesti saatmiseks sätetes valikut \"Keep message "
"content\"."

msgid ""
"The email could not be sent again. The new attempt and its error are in the "
"log."
msgstr "E-kirja ei õnnestunud uuesti saata. Uus katse ja selle viga on logis."

msgid "Date (UTC)"
msgstr "Kuupäev (UTC)"

msgid "Recipients"
msgstr "Saajad"

msgid "Lynbro SMTP email log"
msgstr "Lynbro SMTP e-kirjade logi"

msgid ""
"The rest of the suite. What is already on this site is marked; nothing "
"installs without you asking for it."
msgstr ""
"Ülejäänud komplekt. See, mis on juba sellel saidil olemas, on märgitud; "
"midagi ei paigaldata ilma teie loata."

msgid "Active"
msgstr "Aktiivne"

msgid "Activate"
msgstr "Aktiveeri"

msgid "Install now"
msgstr "Paigalda kohe"

msgid "View on WordPress.org"
msgstr "Vaata WordPress.org-is"

msgid ""
"Shared Lynbro components v%1$s, provided by %2$s (newest of %3$d versions on"
" this site)."
msgstr ""
"Jagatud Lynbro komponendid v%1$s, pakub %2$s (uusim %3$d sellel saidil "
"olevast versioonist)."

msgid "Reset all settings to defaults?"
msgstr "Kas lähtestada kõik sätted vaikeväärtustele?"

msgid ""
"Is Lynbro SMTP getting your email delivered? A few words on WordPress.org "
"help others find a mail plugin without upsells."
msgstr ""
"Kas Lynbro SMTP toimetab teie e-kirju kohale? Paar sõna WordPress.org-is "
"aitavad teistel leida meiliplugina ilma müügipakkumisteta."

msgid "Write a review"
msgstr "Kirjuta arvustus"

msgid "No thanks"
msgstr "Ei, aitäh"

msgid ""
"Redirect mode needs an address to redirect to — mail is sent normally until "
"you add one."
msgstr ""
"Ümbersuunamise režiim vajab ümbersuunamisaadressi — seni saadetakse kiri "
"tavapäraselt, kuni lisate ühe."

msgid "Other SMTP server"
msgstr "Muu SMTP-server"

msgid "Use the SMTP details from your host or email provider."
msgstr "Kasutage oma hosti või e-posti teenusepakkuja SMTP-andmeid."

msgid ""
"Username: your full Gmail address. Password: an app password (Google Account"
" → Security → 2-Step Verification → App passwords), not your normal "
"password."
msgstr ""
"Kasutajanimi: teie täielik Gmaili aadress. Parool: rakenduse parool "
"(Google'i konto → Turvalisus → Kaheastmeline kinnitamine → Rakenduse "
"paroolid), mitte teie tavaline parool."

msgid ""
"Microsoft 365 needs \"Authenticated SMTP\" enabled for the mailbox. "
"Microsoft is retiring password sign-in for SMTP; if login fails, use a relay"
" service such as Brevo or your host's SMTP."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft 365 vajab postkasti jaoks lubatud \"Authenticated SMTP\"-d. "
"Microsoft loobub SMTP puhul parooliga sisselogimisest; kui sisselogimine "
"ebaõnnestub, kasutage releeteenust nagu Brevo või oma hosti SMTP-d."

msgid ""
"Username: the SMTP login shown under SMTP & API. Password: an SMTP key, not "
"your account password."
msgstr ""
"Kasutajanimi: SMTP sisselogimisnimi, mis kuvatakse jaotises SMTP & API. "
"Parool: SMTP-võti, mitte teie konto parool."

msgid "Username: the word \"apikey\". Password: your SendGrid API key."
msgstr "Kasutajanimi: sõna \"apikey\". Parool: teie SendGridi API-võti."

msgid ""
"EU accounts use smtp.eu.mailgun.org. Username and password: the SMTP "
"credentials of your sending domain."
msgstr ""
"EL-i kontod kasutavad smtp.eu.mailgun.org. Kasutajanimi ja parool: teie "
"saatvadomeeni SMTP-krediendid."

msgid ""
"Change the region in the host to yours. Username and password: SMTP "
"credentials created in the SES console (not your AWS access keys)."
msgstr ""
"Muutke hostis piirkond enda omaks. Kasutajanimi ja parool: SES-i konsoolis "
"loodud SMTP-krediendid (mitte teie AWS-i juurdepääsuvõtmed)."

msgid "Username and password: both are your Server API token."
msgstr "Kasutajanimi ja parool: mõlemad on teie Server API tunnus."

msgid ""
"Use smtp.zoho.com for accounts outside the EU. With two-factor sign-in, "
"create an app-specific password."
msgstr ""
"Kasutage piirkondade jaoks väljaspool EL-i smtp.zoho.com-i. Kahefaktorilise "
"sisselogimise korral looge rakendusepõhine parool."

msgid "Username: API key. Password: secret key."
msgstr "Kasutajanimi: API-võti. Parool: salajane võti."

msgid ""
"Username and password: an SMTP user created under Sending → SMTP Users."
msgstr ""
"Kasutajanimi ja parool: SMTP-kasutaja, mis on loodud jaotises Sending → SMTP"
" Users."

msgid "Username: the full mailbox address. Password: the mailbox password."
msgstr "Kasutajanimi: täielik postkasti aadress. Parool: postkasti parool."

msgid ""
"Use smtp.ionos.de or smtp.ionos.co.uk for those regions. Username: the full "
"mailbox address."
msgstr ""
"Kasutage nende piirkondade jaoks smtp.ionos.de või smtp.ionos.co.uk. "
"Kasutajanimi: täielik postkasti aadress."

msgid "https://plugins.lynbro.dk/lynbro-smtp"
msgstr "https://plugins.lynbro.dk/lynbro-smtp"

msgid ""
"Sends all WordPress email through your own SMTP server, with a searchable "
"email log, resend, a backup connection, failure alerts and connection "
"diagnostics. No upsells."
msgstr ""
"Saadab kõik WordPressi e-kirjad läbi teie oma SMTP-serveri, otsitava "
"e-kirjade logi, taaslähtestamise, varuühenduse, tõrkehoiatuste ja ühenduse "
"diagnostikaga. Ei mingeid lisamüüke."

msgid "lynbro aps"
msgstr "lynbro aps"

msgid "https://lynbro.dk"
msgstr "https://lynbro.dk"

msgid ""
"Host: the SMTP endpoint of your SES region, shown in the SES console under "
"SMTP settings. Username and password: SMTP credentials created in the SES "
"console (not your AWS access keys)."
msgstr ""
"Host: teie SES-i regiooni SMTP lõpp-punkt, mida kuvatakse SES-i konsoolis "
"SMTP seadete all. Username and password: SES-i konsoolis loodud SMTP "
"volitused (mitte teie AWS-i pääsuvõtmed)."

msgid "Lynbro SMTP Mailer"
msgstr "Lynbro SMTP Mailer"

msgid "https://plugins.lynbro.dk/lynbro-smtp-mailer"
msgstr "https://plugins.lynbro.dk/lynbro-smtp-mailer"

msgid "LynBro ApS"
msgstr "LynBro ApS"

msgid ""
"Optional. A Slack or Discord incoming webhook, or your own HTTPS endpoint "
"(JSON with \"text\" and \"content\"). The plugin posts the error text there "
"— nothing else, and only when you set a URL."
msgstr ""
"Valikuline. Slacki või Discordi sissetulev veebikonks või teie enda HTTPS-i "
"lõpp-punkt (JSON väljadega \"text\" ja \"content\"). Plugin postitab sinna "
"veateksti — mitte midagi muud ja ainult siis, kui määrate URL-i."

msgid "Is %s doing its job?"
msgstr "Kas %s teeb oma tööd?"

msgid ""
"You have used it for a couple of weeks now. If it works for you, a short "
"review on WordPress.org helps other site owners find it — honest ones, "
"critical ones included."
msgstr ""
"Oled seda kasutanud juba paar nädalat. Kui see töötab sinu jaoks, aitab "
"lühike arvustus WordPress.org-is ka teisi saidiomanikke — nii ausad kui ka "
"kriitilised arvamused on teretulnud."

msgid ""
"You have used it for a couple of weeks now. If it works for you — or if "
"something is missing — tell us on our public roadmap. That is how we decide "
"what to build next."
msgstr ""
"Oled seda kasutanud juba paar nädalat. Kui see töötab sinu jaoks — või kui "
"midagi on puudu — anna meile teada meie avalikus arenguplaanis. Selle põhjal"
" otsustame, mida järgmisena arendada."

msgid "(opens in a new tab)"
msgstr "(avaneb uues vahekaardis)"

msgid "Share feedback"
msgstr "Jaga tagasisidet"

msgid "Maybe later"
msgstr "Võib-olla hiljem"

msgid "Don't ask again"
msgstr "Ära küsi enam"

msgid "Something not working? Ask for help"
msgstr "Midagi ei tööta? Küsi abi"

msgid "WooCommerce is active"
msgstr "WooCommerce on aktiivne"

msgid "a form plugin is active"
msgstr "vormiplugin on aktiivne"

msgid "the site is set up for Denmark"
msgstr "sait on seadistatud Taani jaoks"

msgid "comments are open"
msgstr "kommentaarid on avatud"

msgid "tracking tags are active"
msgstr "jälgimissildid on aktiivsed"

msgid "visitors can create accounts"
msgstr "külastajad saavad luua kontosid"

msgid "Suggested because %l."
msgstr "Soovitatud, kuna %l."

msgid "Suggested for this site"
msgstr "Soovitatud sellele saidile"

msgid "Hide suggestions"
msgstr "Peida soovitused"

msgid ""
"Other Lynbro plugins that fit what this site uses. Nothing is installed "
"unless you click."
msgstr ""
"Teised Lynbro pluginad, mis sobivad selle saidi kasutusega. Midagi ei "
"paigaldata enne, kui ise klikid."

msgid "All Lynbro plugins"
msgstr "Kõik Lynbro pluginad"

msgid ""
"Picked from what this site already uses — read on this site, nothing is sent"
" anywhere."
msgstr ""
"Valitud selle põhjal, mida see sait juba kasutab — loetakse ainult sellel "
"saidil, midagi ei saadeta kuhugi."

msgid "Image Optimizer"
msgstr "Pildi optimeerija"

msgid ""
"Convert to WebP and AVIF, right-size oversized images and lazy-load them — "
"all on your own server."
msgstr ""
"Konverteeri WebP ja AVIF vormingusse, kohanda liiga suuri pilte ja lae need "
"laisalt — kõik sinu enda serveris."

msgid "AI Studio"
msgstr "AI Stuudio"

msgid ""
"Write and illustrate posts with AI on your own OpenAI key — at cost, with no"
" credits in between."
msgstr ""
"Kirjuta ja illustreeri postitusi tehisintellektiga, kasutades oma OpenAI "
"võtit — otsehinnaga, ilma vahendustasudeta."

msgid "Analytics"
msgstr "Analüütika"

msgid ""
"Self-hosted, cookieless analytics with funnels. Visitor data never leaves "
"your database."
msgstr ""
"Isehostitud, küpsisteta analüütika koos lehtritega. Külastaja andmed ei "
"lahku sinu andmebaasist."

msgid "Tags"
msgstr "Sildid"

msgid ""
"GA4, Tag Manager, Google Ads, Meta Pixel and more without code — each tag "
"waits for consent."
msgstr ""
"GA4, Tag Manager, Google Ads, Meta Pixel ja palju muud ilma koodita — iga "
"silt ootab nõusolekut."

msgid "Forms"
msgstr "Vormid"

msgid ""
"Forms with entries saved for free and no cap, conditional logic checked "
"server-side, and signed webhooks."
msgstr ""
"Vormid, mille sisestused salvestatakse tasuta ja piiranguteta, "
"tingimusloogika kontroll serveris ning allkirjastatud veebikonksud."

msgid "Verify"
msgstr "Kinnita"

msgid ""
"Catch mistyped e-mail domains and bad phone numbers, and confirm them with a"
" one-time code by e-mail or SMS."
msgstr ""
"Tuvasta valesti sisestatud e-posti domeenid ja vigased telefoninumbrid ning "
"kinnita need ühekordse koodiga e-posti või SMS-i teel."

msgid "Cache"
msgstr "Vahemälu"

msgid ""
"Reliable purging for an nginx FastCGI cache and a Redis object cache, with "
"every purge verified against the cache itself."
msgstr ""
"Usaldusväärne puhastamine nginx FastCGI ja Redis objektivahemälu jaoks, iga "
"puhastus kontrollitakse vahemälu vastu."

msgid "Translate"
msgstr "Tõlgi"

msgid ""
"Run your site in several languages, with machine translation on your own "
"OpenAI key — nothing metered, nothing sold by the word."
msgstr ""
"Halda oma saiti mitmes keeles, masintõlge oma OpenAI võtmega — midagi ei "
"mõõdeta ega müüda sõna kaupa."

msgid "Shield"
msgstr "Kaitse"

msgid ""
"Security headers, HTTPS with HSTS, a small firewall against injection probes"
" and the hardening switches every site needs."
msgstr ""
"Turvapealkirjad, HTTPS koos HSTS-iga, väike tulemüür süstimisproovide vastu "
"ja vajalikud turvalülitid igale saidile."

msgid "Anti-Spam"
msgstr "Rämpsposti tõrje"

msgid ""
"Spam checks that run on your own server. No account, no subscription, every "
"block says why — and a held message is never lost."
msgstr ""
"Rämpsposti kontrollid töötavad sinu serveris. Pole kontot ega tellimust, iga"
" blokeering põhjendatud — ja kinnipeetud sõnum ei lähe kaduma."

msgid "Login Guard"
msgstr "Sisselogimise kaitse"

msgid ""
"Move wp-login.php, limit failed sign-ins and add app-based two-factor — with"
" three ways back in."
msgstr ""
"Liiguta wp-login.php, piira ebaõnnestunud sisselogimisi ja lisa "
"rakendusepõhine kaheastmeline autentimine — kolm võimalust tagasi "
"pääsemiseks."

msgid "Cookie Consent"
msgstr "Küpsiste nõusolek"

msgid ""
"A GDPR and ePrivacy banner with Consent Mode v2, an equally prominent Reject"
" button and 35 languages."
msgstr ""
"GDPR-i ja ePrivaatsuse bänner Consent Mode v2-ga, võrdselt nähtav Keeldu "
"nupp ja 35 keelt."

msgid "Activity Log"
msgstr "Tegevuslogi"

msgid ""
"Who did what, when and from where — written down on your own server, "
"searchable, exportable, and deleted on your schedule."
msgstr ""
"Kes, mida, millal ja kust — salvestatud sinu serverisse, otsitav, "
"eksporditav ja kustutatav sinu ajakava järgi."

msgid "Data Retention"
msgstr "Andmete säilitamine"

msgid ""
"Find where personal data actually sits in your database, then delete it on a"
" schedule — with a dry run before every deletion."
msgstr ""
"Leia, kus isikuandmed tegelikult sinu andmebaasis asuvad, ja kustuta need "
"ajakava alusel — iga kustutamise eel eelvaade."

msgid "Accessibility"
msgstr "Juurdepääsetavus"

msgid ""
"Scan every page against WCAG 2.2 AA and fix what can be fixed safely. No "
"overlay, no page limit."
msgstr ""
"Skaneeri iga leht WCAG 2.2 AA järgi ja paranda, mis on turvaliselt "
"parandatav. Pole ülekatet ega lehepiirangut."

msgid "SEO"
msgstr "SEO"

msgid ""
"Lean SEO with free LocalBusiness schema, sitemaps and social cards. Nothing "
"phones home."
msgstr ""
"Kerge SEO tasuta LocalBusiness skeemi, saidikaartide ja sotsiaalkaartidega. "
"Midagi ei saadeta välja."

msgid "SMTP Mailer"
msgstr "SMTP saatja"

msgid ""
"WordPress email through your own SMTP server — with an email log, resend, a "
"backup connection and failure alerts."
msgstr ""
"WordPressi e-post sinu enda SMTP serveri kaudu — koos e-posti logi, uuesti "
"saatmise, varuühenduse ja tõrgeteavitustega."

msgid "Social Feed"
msgstr "Sotsiaalvoog"

msgid ""
"An Instagram feed on your site without a Meta token stored in WordPress."
msgstr ""
"Instagrami voog sinu saidil ilma Meta tokenit WordPressis salvestamata."

msgid "Reviews Cache"
msgstr "Arvustuste vahemälu"

msgid "Show your Google reviews without putting an API key in WordPress."
msgstr "Näita oma Google'i arvustusi ilma API võtit WordPressi salvestamata."

msgid "Links"
msgstr "Lingid"

msgid ""
"Find broken links and manage redirects on your own server, with the reason "
"for every verdict."
msgstr ""
"Leia katkised lingid ja halda ümbersuunamisi oma serveris, iga otsuse põhjus"
" on nähtav."

msgid "Danadresse Autofill"
msgstr "Danadresse automaattäitmine"

msgid ""
"Danish address autocomplete and validation for WooCommerce, WPForms, "
"Gravity, Fluent, Formidable and EDD."
msgstr ""
"Taani aadressi automaatne täitmine ja valideerimine WooCommerce’i, WPFormsi,"
" Gravity, Fluenti, Formidable’i ja EDD jaoks."

msgid "Soge Lookup"
msgstr "Soge otsing"

msgid ""
"Look up Danish vehicles (DMR) and companies (CVR) by plate, VIN or CVR "
"number."
msgstr ""
"Taani sõidukite (DMR) ja ettevõtete (CVR) otsing numbri, VIN-i või CVR "
"numbri alusel."

msgid "CVR Checkout"
msgstr "CVR kassasüsteem"

msgid ""
"Danish B2B checkout for WooCommerce: CVR company autofill, CVR/EU-VAT (VIES)"
" validation and an EAN/GLN field."
msgstr ""
"Taani B2B kassasüsteem WooCommerce’ile: CVR ettevõtte automaattäitmine, "
"CVR/EU-KM (VIES) valideerimine ja EAN/GLN väli."

msgid "Danish Shipping"
msgstr "Taani tarne"

msgid ""
"Free pickup point selection for PostNord and GLS Denmark at the WooCommerce "
"checkout, plus clean shipping methods."
msgstr ""
"Tasuta pakiautomaadi valik PostNordile ja GLS Denmarkile WooCommerce’i "
"kassas, lisaks selged tarnemeetodid."

msgid "API Auth"
msgstr "API autentimine"

msgid ""
"JSON Web Tokens for the REST API that you can actually revoke, with scopes "
"and a journal of refusals."
msgstr ""
"JSON Web Tokenid REST API jaoks, mida saab tegelikult tühistada, koos "
"õiguste ja keeldumiste logiga."

msgid "Failure alerts by email do not get out"
msgstr "E-posti tõrketeateid ei saadeta välja"

msgid ""
"The alert email is sent with PHP mail() so that it does not depend on the "
"SMTP server, but PHP mail() failed on this server: %s Use a webhook for "
"alerts, or ask your host to enable mail()."
msgstr ""
"Häiremeil saadetakse PHP mail()-iga, nii et see ei sõltu SMTP-serverist, "
"kuid PHP mail() ebaõnnestus selles serveris: %s Kasutage häirete jaoks "
"veebikonksu või paluge oma hostiteenuse pakkujal mail() lubada."

msgid ""
"This is the previous version of Lynbro SMTP. Lynbro SMTP Mailer has replaced"
" it and uses the same settings. Remove the folder %s with your host's file "
"manager, FTP or SSH — do not use Delete here: its uninstall erases the "
"shared SMTP settings. Lynbro SMTP Mailer keeps a backup and puts them back, "
"but the old plugin also empties the email log."
msgstr ""
"See on Lynbro SMTP eelmine versioon. Selle on asendanud Lynbro SMTP Mailer, "
"mis kasutab samu seadeid. Eemaldage kaust %s oma veebimajutuse failihalduri,"
" FTP või SSH kaudu — ärge kasutage siin käsku „Kustuta“, sest selle abil "
"eemaldamine kustutab jagatud SMTP-seaded. Lynbro SMTP Mailer hoiab "
"varukoopiat ja taastab seaded, kuid vana plugin tühjendab ka e-kirjade logi."

msgid ""
"Your SMTP settings were deleted by another plugin on %s and have been "
"restored from the backup. Nothing for you to do; send a test email if you "
"want to be sure."
msgstr ""
"Teine plugin kustutas teie SMTP-seaded kuupäeval %s ja need on varukoopiast "
"taastatud. Teil pole vaja midagi teha; soovi korral saatke kontrollimiseks "
"testkiri."

msgid ""
"This site sends with the server's own mail (PHP mail()). The test shows "
"whether the server accepted the email; check its headers in the inbox "
"(Authentication-Results: spf=pass, dmarc=pass)."
msgstr ""
"See sait saadab kirju serveri enda meiliteenusega (PHP mail()). Test näitab,"
" kas server võttis e-kirja vastu; kontrollige postkastis selle päiseid "
"(Authentication-Results: spf=pass, dmarc=pass)."

msgid ""
"Make sure it includes this web server (its IP address with ip4: or ip6:, or "
"a: / mx: that resolves to it)."
msgstr ""
"Veenduge, et see sisaldaks seda veebiserverit (selle IP-aadressiga kirje "
"ip4: või ip6: või sellele viitava kirjega a: / mx:)."

msgid ""
"Email is sent with this server's own mail (PHP mail()), from %s, with a "
"matching Return-Path."
msgstr ""
"E-kirjad saadetakse selle serveri enda meiliteenusega (PHP mail()) "
"aadressilt %s ja vastava Return-Pathiga."

msgid ""
"Return-Path is off: the server puts its own address on the envelope, so SPF "
"checks that domain instead of yours."
msgstr ""
"Return-Path on välja lülitatud: server lisab ümbrikule enda aadressi, "
"mistõttu kontrollib SPF selle domeeni, mitte teie domeeni."

msgid "Email is sent with the server's own mail, with a matching sender"
msgstr ""
"E-kirjad saadetakse serveri enda meiliteenusega ja saatja aadress on "
"vastavuses"

msgid ""
"Lynbro SMTP sends with PHP mail() by your choice and sets the From address "
"and Return-Path on every email. Keep this server in the domain's SPF record."
msgstr ""
"Lynbro SMTP saadab teie valikul kirju funktsiooniga PHP mail() ning määrab "
"igale e-kirjale From-aadressi ja Return-Pathi. Lisage see server domeeni "
"SPF-kirjesse."

msgid "This server's own mail (PHP mail(), no SMTP)"
msgstr "Selle serveri enda meiliteenus (PHP mail(), SMTP-ta)"

msgid ""
"For servers that are set up to send mail themselves. No login needed: the "
"From address and the Return-Path below are still set on every email, so SPF "
"and DMARC can line up. The domain's SPF record must include this server."
msgstr ""
"Serveritele, mis on seadistatud ise kirju saatma. Sisselogimist pole vaja: "
"allpool olevad From-aadress ja Return-Path määratakse endiselt igale "
"e-kirjale, et SPF ja DMARC oleksid kooskõlas. Domeeni SPF-kirje peab seda "
"serverit sisaldama."
